Aklys, bardiche, bec de corbin, bill guisarme, guisarme, halberd, ranseur,
spetum and voulge are all pole arms : all related to the spear but with
different shaped tips.

If you look into a copy of Unearthed Arcana (from the AD&D series)
you will find descriptions and drawings of most of them.(somewhere in 
the back of the book)

As for a katana ... It is a sword that was used by Samoerai in Japan.

